RULE LOADED: 031-frontend-conventions

- Customer-facing strings are Bahasa Indonesia. Code, comments, and commits
  stay English.
- Display money with `toLocaleString('id-ID')` on integer rupiah. Do not
  introduce floating-point currency.
- `frontend/src/api/client.js` still unwraps v1 `payload.result` for existing
  calls. That is deliberate. New v2 endpoints expose `payload.data` — add a
  dedicated reader, do not rewrite the v1 helpers unless the ticket is the
  API contract migration (`TASKS.md` Task 1).
- Give interactive controls a visible label. Do not change fee, quota, or
  settlement behaviour from the client.
